message: "If you use this software, please cite it together with BodyParts3D (Mitsuhashi et al. 2009). The meshes embedded in index.html remain under CC BY-SA 2.1 Japan (see DATA_SOURCES.md)."
title: "Virtual Shoulder 3D: browser-based 3D visualisation and planning aid for arthroscopic superior capsular reconstruction with the long head of the biceps tendon"
type: software
version: "0.20"
date-released: 2026-11-03
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Ho"
    given-names: "Sy Nam"
    affiliation: "Saigon ITO Phu Nhuan Hospital, Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam"
