    description: "All versions (concept DOI)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lamkienthanh92/vitualshoulder"
keywords:
  - shoulder
  - superior capsular reconstruction
  - long head of the biceps tendon
  - rotator cuff
  - surgical planning
  - 3D visualisation
  - DICOM
abstract: "Single-file web application (no installation, runs offline after the first load) that shows shoulder anatomy and kinematics, simulates graft length through glenohumeral abduction for seven superior capsular reconstruction techniques, and reads preoperative DICOM or STL data to place landmarks and plan the graft. A visualisation aid, not a medical device."
